WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.680
The Coris answered a question physiology had only hand-waved at where the lactate

2
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:14.600
of a sprinting muscle goes, and where its next push of fuel comes from by measuring

3
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.160
sugar quantitatively through the whole living animal.

4
00:00:17.933 --> 00:00:22.613
They found a circuit: muscle breaks glucose to lactate, the blood carries it to the

5
00:00:22.613 --> 00:00:25.713
liver, the liver rebuilds glucose and sends it back.

6
00:00:26.517 --> 00:00:30.877
It was the first inter-organ cycle, and it made the body's fuel economy something

7
00:00:30.877 --> 00:00:31.877
you could draw.

8
00:00:46.783 --> 00:00:50.163
Gerty Cori became the first woman to win the Nobel Prize in Medicine.
